I am an intermediate sort of Nethack player, but I have done enough
reading and trial and error to probably give some usefull tips.

1. First drink on a fountain can give a stat boost (1/7 chance iirc).
This applies to the first drink only, so when I am strong enough, I go
back to all the fountains and take 1 sip. This might be a total waste
of time, because it is very easy to get potions of gain ability, bless
them and boost all your stats. the b%oGA is also far safer than the
(moderately safe) fountain drinking.

2. Fountains are easy to dig (I use a pick-ax) and create pools
everywhere when dug. Find a fountain in a room with doors you can
lock. Lock the works, get neked (naked:), carry only useless
scrolls/potions and take a dip 1 of the pools formed. You can blank,
dilute all ?/% this way, and turns out to be relatively safe. I found
a way to dip bags into pools or fountains once, which diluted
everything and was pretty safe to do, cause you don't have to be armor
free, but now I forgot.

Other than blanking, and making water potions (used for blessing later
by El God-o), and the occassional potential stat boost, fountains are
pretty.

Good luck.

